{"suttaId":"thi-ap6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6677,6717],"vripara":"46"},"segments":{"thi-ap6:0.3":"Ekapiṇḍapātadāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap6:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā, bandhumā nāma khattiyo;","thi-ap6:1.3":"Tassa rañño ahuṃ bhariyā, ekajjhaṃ cārayāmahaṃ [ekaccaṃ vādayāmahaṃ (syā.)].","thi-ap6:2.1":"“Rahogatā nisīditvā, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap6:2.3":"‘Ādāya gamanīyañhi, kusalaṃ natthi me kataṃ.","thi-ap6:3.1":"“‘Mahābhitāpaṃ kaṭukaṃ, ghorarūpaṃ sudāruṇaṃ;","thi-ap6:3.3":"Nirayaṃ nūna gacchāmi, ettha me natthi saṃsayo’.","thi-ap6:4.1":"“Rājānaṃ upasaṅkamma, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ;","thi-ap6:4.3":"‘Ekaṃ me samaṇaṃ dehi, bhojayissāmi khattiya’.","thi-ap6:5.1":"“Adāsi me mahārājā, samaṇaṃ bhāvitindriyaṃ;","thi-ap6:5.3":"Tassa pattaṃ gahetvāna, paramannena pūrayiṃ [tappayiṃ (sī.)].","thi-ap6:6.1":"“Pūrayitvā paramannaṃ, gandhālepaṃ akāsahaṃ;","thi-ap6:6.3":"Jālena pidahitvāna, vatthayugena [pītacoḷena (syā.), mahānelena (pī.)] chādayiṃ.","thi-ap6:7.1":"“Ārammaṇaṃ mamaṃ etaṃ, sarāmi yāvajīvihaṃ;","thi-ap6:7.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap6:8.1":"“Tiṃsānaṃ devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap6:8.3":"Manasā patthitaṃ mayhaṃ, nibbattati yathicchitaṃ [yaticchakaṃ (syā.), yadicchakaṃ (pī. ka.)].","thi-ap6:9.1":"“Vīsānaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap6:9.3":"Ocitattāva [upacitattā (syā.)] hutvāna, saṃsarāmi bhavesvahaṃ.","thi-ap6:10.1":"“Sabbabandhanamuttāhaṃ, apetā me upādikā;","thi-ap6:10.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap6:11.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap6:11.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap6:12.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap6:13.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap6:14.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap6:15.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ ekapiṇḍapātadāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap6:16.1":"Ekapiṇḍapātadāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
